---
import { site } from '../site';
---

<section class="author-bio" aria-labelledby="author-bio-title">
  <h2 class="author-name" id="author-bio-title">Written by {site.author.name}</h2>
  <p>
    Korean skincare has been part of {site.author.name}'s life for as long as she can remember. She has slightly dry,
    slightly sensitive skin and usually shops with barrier support and anti-aging in mind.
    She buys products herself from Amazon and Olive Young, and she writes about both
    the ones she keeps and the ones she stops using.
  </p>
</section>
